title: Investigating Domestic Enemies
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
#card-image: img/es/leaders/galarza.png
#is-card: true
#new-page: true

# this is not a card - reached only via government_affairs/police.scene.dry's menu.

= Investigating Domestic Enemies

Through our influence over the Interior Ministry, we can direct police attention toward the armed organizations contesting the streets - the Falangist militia, the Carlist Requetés, and the anarcho-syndicalist CNT-FAI. We can proscribe them outright, though a ban rarely stops a determined militia from operating underground.

- @ban_falange: Ban the Falangist militia.
- @unban_falange: Unban the Falangist militia.
- @persecute_falange
- @ban_requetes: Ban the Requetés.
- @unban_requetes: Unban the Requetés.
- @persecute_requetes
- @ban_cnt: Ban the CNT militia.
- @unban_cnt: Unban the CNT militia.
- @persecute_cnt

@ban_falange
view-if: nazi_urgency >= 3 and falange_militia_banned == 0
on-arrival: falange_militia_strength *= 0.85; falange_militia_strength *= 0.7 if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7; falange_militia_banned = 1; radical_relation -= 3; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; falange_militia_militancy -= 0.05; coup_progress -= 2 if coup_progress >= 6

As it turns out, the Falangist militia has allies within the police and bureaucracy. Our relationship with the police weakens, and the militia can still organize illegally, right under the authorities' noses.

[? if coup_progress >= 6: There are reports of an imminent rising by the far right. We have disrupted some of these plans, but the threat is still present. ?]

@unban_falange
view-if: falange_militia_banned = 1
on-arrival: falange_militia_banned = 0; falange_militia_strength += 100; falange_militia_militancy += 0.05; coup_progress += 2 if coup_progress >= 6

The Falangist militia is no longer banned. They immediately go on a recruiting spree.

@persecute_falange
title: Further persecute the Falangist militia.
view-if: falange_militia_banned = 1
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 3 and interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The judiciary would not allow this. ?] [? if interior_police_loyalty < 0.7 : The police are too disloyal to be trusted with this. ?]
on-arrival: falange_militia_strength *= 0.7; falange_militia_militancy -= 0.05; coup_progress -= 2 if coup_progress >= 4

We have arrested more of the Falangist militia's leaders and confiscated their weapons.

[? if coup_progress >= 4: There are reports of a planned rising by the far right. We have cracked down on some of these plans, but the threat still lingers. ?]

@ban_requetes
on-arrival: requetes_strength *= 0.85; requetes_strength *= 0.7 if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7; requetes_banned = 1; monarchist_relation -= 5; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; requetes_militancy -= 0.05; coup_progress -= 1 if coup_progress >= 6; president_angry += 8
view-if: requetes_banned == 0

Banning the Requetés weakens our relationship with the monarchist right and the police. In addition, the Requetés still operate out of public sight, drilling quietly in Navarre.

@unban_requetes
view-if: requetes_banned = 1
on-arrival: requetes_banned = 0; requetes_strength += 100; coup_progress += 2 if coup_progress >= 6; president_angry -= 5

The Requetés are no longer banned.

@persecute_requetes
title: Further persecute the Requetés.
view-if: requetes_banned = 1
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 4 and interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 4 : The judiciary would not allow this. ?] [? if interior_police_loyalty < 0.7 : The police are too disloyal to be trusted with this. ?]
on-arrival: requetes_strength *= 0.7; requetes_militancy -= 0.05; monarchist_relation -= 5; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; coup_progress -= 1 if coup_progress >= 4; president_angry += 5

We have arrested more of the Requetés' leaders and confiscated their weapons.

[? if coup_progress >= 4: There are reports of a planned rising by the far right. We have cracked down on some of these plans, but the threat still lingers. ?]

@ban_cnt
view-if: anarchist_insurrection < 3 and cnt_militia_banned = 0
on-arrival: pce_relation -= 15; cnt_militia_strength -= 50; cnt_militia_banned = 1; anarchist_strength -= 20; ceda_relation += 5; radical_relation += 5; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1

The ban is enthusiastically carried out by the police, perhaps too enthusiastically. The anarchists take this as one more reason the <span style="color: #c00000;">Socialists</span> are traitors to the working class. However, the propertied and republican-right parties approve, as do the police.

@unban_cnt
view-if: cnt_militia_banned = 1
on-arrival: cnt_militia_banned = 0; pce_relation += 5; cnt_militia_strength += 50; anarchist_strength += 20; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05

The CNT militia is no longer banned.

@persecute_cnt
title: Further persecute the CNT militia.
view-if: cnt_militia_banned = 1
on-arrival: cnt_militia_strength *= 0.7; anarchist_militancy -= 0.05; pce_relation -= 10; ceda_relation += 2; radical_relation += 2; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1

We have arrested more of the CNT-FAI's leaders and confiscated their weapons.
